"Add to VoiceBrief" = "添加到 VoiceBrief";
"Securely copying the voice note…" = "正在安全复制语音消息…";
"Your brief is ready" = "您的摘要已就绪";
"%d date item(s) found. Tap to review the brief and add dates." = "找到 %d 个日期。点按以查看摘要并添加日期。";
"Processing is complete. Tap to view the brief." = "处理完成。点按查看摘要。";
"Preparing your brief" = "正在准备摘要";
"Your brief is being prepared. You can close this window now; we'll notify you when it's ready." = "正在准备您的摘要。现在可以关闭此窗口，完成后我们会通知您。";
"The result was saved, but VoiceBrief notifications are disabled. Enable them in iPhone Settings so the ready alert can open the brief directly." = "结果已保存，但 VoiceBrief 通知已关闭。请在 iPhone 设置中启用通知，以便从提醒直接打开摘要。";
"Done" = "完成";
"Voice note saved" = "语音消息已保存";
"Open VoiceBrief once after updating to prepare your account for sharing, then share the voice note again." = "更新后请先打开一次 VoiceBrief，为账户准备分享功能，然后重新分享语音消息。";
"The file was saved, but its duration could not be read for in-share processing." = "文件已保存，但无法读取时长，暂不能在此处理。";
"The voice note was saved, but an internet connection is required to finish the brief." = "语音消息已保存，但需要连接互联网才能完成摘要。";
"The voice note was saved, but your available minutes are not enough to process it." = "语音消息已保存，但您的分钟额度不足以处理。";
"The voice note was saved, but processing is unavailable right now. Try sharing again shortly." = "语音消息已保存，但处理暂不可用，请稍后重新分享。";
"Import failed" = "导入失败";
"Close" = "关闭";
"WhatsApp did not provide a readable audio file. Select only the voice note and share again." = "WhatsApp 未提供可读取的音频。请仅选择语音消息后重新分享。";
"This audio file could not be read. Download the voice note in WhatsApp, then share it again." = "无法读取音频。请先在 WhatsApp 下载语音消息，然后重新分享。";
"The voice note must be smaller than 25 MB." = "语音消息必须小于 25 MB。";
"This build cannot access shared storage. The app and Share Extension must be signed with App Groups." = "此版本无法访问共享存储。应用和分享扩展必须使用 App Groups 签名。";
"The voice note could not be saved for the app. Open VoiceBrief once, then try again." = "无法为应用保存语音消息。请先打开一次 VoiceBrief，再重试。";
